S5-07 ELF stack-copy snapshot exact-nonce replays — 2026-11-17

Purpose and source
------------------
Two local macOS/aarch64 release-runner replays used the exact nonce, canonical
kernel, initramfs, ACPI blob, Stage4A/CPL0/user-mode profile, RAM size, and
3,000,000,000 instruction budget of the two runs in
`s5-07-counted-canonical-n2-20261117-a`. The only added execution option was
`--execution-observations-out <run-sidecar>` with
`--execution-observations-elf-stack-copy`. The source series remains
`smoke_not_acceptance`; these replays are diagnostic and do not change its
strict comparison result.

Canonical input hashes were verified by the runner:

* kernel: `9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e`
* initramfs: `ee9183a4eded3c16a8c6a7a81c6d5bb79be8bb023f793f7cd61694ea2bd3e588`
* ACPI blob: `b1ba6078a4d9bc7a8d224980713d8242e4a708743ce4f56093b00a07c631ffaf`
* ACPI manifest: `2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2`

The first attempted run used the Stage 4 fixture ACPI blob
(`6fc25b091348d8ad314bdd0f4f579ec9dd3969c961020a7a61d2daeb8dc26d4d`), which
was not the canonical source input. That attempt is retained under the ignored
`run-0001-wrong-acpi/` artifact directory and excluded from all results below.
The valid run 0001 retry used the canonical blob above; run 0002 used it from
the start.

Command template (run once for each row's nonce and output directory):

```sh
target/release/od-runner linux-direct \
  --vmlinuz work/stage4/linux-7.0.0-38.38/vmlinuz-7.0.0-38-generic \
  --initramfs work/stage4/s5-07-canonical-initramfs-rebuild/initramfs.cpio \
  --acpi-blob work/stage5/staging/s5-07-canonical-acpi-20261117.bin \
  --expected-vmlinuz-sha256 9f55ef7253055a9cf68f8a04323c93dead2fca617386d842fbde9ca7b178b27e \
  --expected-initramfs-sha256 ee9183a4eded3c16a8c6a7a81c6d5bb79be8bb023f793f7cd61694ea2bd3e588 \
  --expected-acpi-manifest-hash 2bd690ae0817705b1b128675f9628dd7212fee74ab97c88da3599a1ae8e398f2 \
  --ram-mib 128 --nonce <source-nonce> \
  --out work/stage5/s5-07-elf-copy-exact-replay-20261117-a/<run-dir>/runner.json \
  --run --budget 3000000000 --set-cpl0 --cpuid-profile stage4a --user-mode \
  --execution-observations-out work/stage5/s5-07-elf-copy-exact-replay-20261117-a/<run-dir>/execution-observations.json \
  --execution-observations-elf-stack-copy
```

